libretro: look for the Kickstarts in the system directory's amiga/ folder

Batocera keeps them in bios/amiga/. Search it before the system directory
itself, for the model's Kickstart and for the CD32 and CDTV extended ROMs,
add it to the ROM paths, and accept the file names batocera-systems checks
(kick34005.A500, kick40060.CD32.ext...) as well as the usual ones.

diff --git a/libretro/libretro.cpp b/libretro/libretro.cpp
index eed12c1..2a0d84d 100644
